1
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:08,716
Hi. Welcome to MADHAV Order Desk, a working prototype for

2
00:00:08,716 --> 00:00:13,202
small businesses taking orders through chat. Let me show you

3
00:00:13,202 --> 00:00:15,894
how the owner stays in control.

4
00:00:17,075 --> 00:00:21,726
Here's Aanya. She asks for one chocolate cake tomorrow, in

5
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:26,378
Hinglish, and wants to know the price. Nothing is booked

6
00:00:26,378 --> 00:00:26,843
yet.

7
00:00:28,044 --> 00:00:32,878
I click Prepare reply. This recording uses Sample mode, so

8
00:00:32,878 --> 00:00:37,712
this step is not a live AI request. The demo

9
00:00:37,712 --> 00:00:41,580
correctly identifies the product, quantity, and pickup date.

10
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:47,335
The price comes from the bakery catalog. Nine hundred rupees

11
00:00:47,335 --> 00:00:51,931
total, and four hundred and fifty in suggested advance. I

12
00:00:51,931 --> 00:00:55,148
can still review the details before accepting.

13
00:00:56,336 --> 00:01:00,989
Only when I approve and reserve does that order enter

14
00:01:00,989 --> 00:01:04,712
the system. The confirmation draft updates after reservation.

15
00:01:05,905 --> 00:01:10,844
I approve the reply separately. The message now appears in

16
00:01:10,844 --> 00:01:15,289
the simulated chat. No real WhatsApp message was sent.

17
00:01:16,482 --> 00:01:20,739
Here is Aanya's order in the order book. Nine hundred

18
00:01:20,739 --> 00:01:24,570
rupees in order value, and no payment recorded yet.

19
00:01:25,801 --> 00:01:30,161
Rohan wants Red Velvet. But the bakery has no capacity

20
00:01:30,161 --> 00:01:34,521
for this cake. What happens when a customer asks for

21
00:01:34,521 --> 00:01:36,265
something we cannot make?

22
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:42,301
MADHAV blocks the booking, and lists available alternatives including Vanilla

23
00:01:42,301 --> 00:01:47,143
Cloud. It asks the customer to decide, instead of secretly

24
00:01:47,143 --> 00:01:48,596
changing the order.

25
00:01:50,327 --> 00:01:54,873
Now Rohan replies, Kal one vanilla cake kar do. I'm

26
00:01:54,873 --> 00:01:58,511
adding that as a new fictional customer message.

27
00:01:59,705 --> 00:02:04,207
We prepare the updated request. Vanilla Cloud is available at

28
00:02:04,207 --> 00:02:08,710
seven hundred and fifty rupees. This is the order we

29
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:10,961
can safely review and reserve.

30
00:02:12,220 --> 00:02:16,883
I approve the vanilla reservation and then the reply. Red

31
00:02:16,883 --> 00:02:18,748
Velvet was never booked.

32
00:02:19,931 --> 00:02:24,001
Next is Meera. She wants two boxes of cupcakes for

33
00:02:24,001 --> 00:02:28,071
tomorrow, and we need to keep the order amount separate

34
00:02:28,071 --> 00:02:29,699
from money actually received.

35
00:02:30,887 --> 00:02:35,178
Each box is four hundred and twenty rupees. Two boxes

36
00:02:35,178 --> 00:02:39,469
come to eight hundred and forty. The owner reviews the

37
00:02:39,469 --> 00:02:41,615
price and quantity before booking.

38
00:02:42,847 --> 00:02:46,940
The order is now approved, and so is the reply.

39
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:50,215
That still doesn't mean the customer has paid.

40
00:02:51,396 --> 00:02:55,896
In the Orders screen, Meera's total is eight hundred and

41
00:02:55,896 --> 00:03:00,396
forty. Payment recording requires the owner to confirm it independently.

42
00:03:02,083 --> 00:03:06,770
Suppose I've verified four hundred and twenty rupees received. I'll

43
00:03:06,770 --> 00:03:10,051
enter that amount now, then confirm it.

44
00:03:11,209 --> 00:03:15,803
The remaining balance is four hundred and twenty rupees. Notice

45
00:03:15,803 --> 00:03:20,397
how the order total, paid amount and outstanding balance stay

46
00:03:20,397 --> 00:03:20,857
consistent.

47
00:03:22,045 --> 00:03:27,236
That's MADHAV: checked order preparation, catalog-based pricing, capacity protection, and

48
00:03:27,236 --> 00:03:32,426
owner approval. This is a WhatsApp-style simulation, not a real

49
00:03:32,426 --> 00:03:37,617
WhatsApp integration. Next we plan to test with small businesses

50
00:03:37,617 --> 00:03:40,213
and build the official integration.

